title: "Rental Property Management Software: Empirical Benchmark and Test Artifacts for Risk-Based Test Case Prioritization"
abstract: "A full-stack rental property management system and empirical research benchmark containing 49 automated backend test cases, software requirement specifications, architectural designs, and traceability matrices used for evaluating lightweight Risk-Based Testing (RBT) and Test Case Prioritization (TCP) in small Agile projects."
